  "id": "grave-lantern",
  "title": "Grave Lantern",
  "tagline": "Hold the crypt for three minutes, then kill the Bone Warden.",
  "description": "You are a knight with a lantern in a dark crypt. Drag anywhere and he walks; the sword swings by itself at the nearest skeleton. Skeletons rear back and lunge with a red ring on the floor, mages throw bolts from range, and bigger brutes soak hits, so where you stand and when you dash is the whole decision. A dash passes through enemies and cuts them, so it is both your escape and your attack. Walk over gems, pick one of three upgrades, and survive ten waves (three minutes) that keep growing. Then the Bone Warden wakes, charges at you, and calls more of the horde until one of you falls.",
